### E-CYCLE — USUARIOS (rotas de admin: exigem token de admin)
@url = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1) Faca login como ADMIN primeiro (gera o token)
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "diego@email.com",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

### Listar usuarios
GET {{url}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Criar usuario (admin pode definir o tipo)
POST {{url}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Aluno Admin",
  "email": "aluno.admin@email.com",
  "senha": "segredo123",
  "tipo_usuario": "admin"
}

### Excluir usuario
DELETE {{url}}/usuarios/6
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
